(text "Front panel board. J1 gets a 12-wire IDC ribbon from J24 on the backplane (pin N to pin N).\nButtons pull the FPGA pin to GND (10k pull-ups on the backplane). LEDs: anode from 3V3 through 1k\non the backplane, cathode to the FPGA pin." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "76b441f4-1677-5ad6-9324-82add9494600"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
